# antpdf.py input for
#   Mendelssohn Verleih uns Frieden / Carus 2014 edition with pedal
# putting Hebrew text instead of Latin.
# Usage:
#  annpdf -a mendelssohn-verleih-german-hebrew-pedal.ann \
#    -i Mendelssohn-Verleih-uns-Frieden-carus.pdf \
#    -o Mendelssohn-Verleih_uns_Frieden-Ose_Shalom-pedal.pdf \
#    -f /usr/share/fonts/truetype/culmus/DavidCLM-Medium.otf
#    -d 15

# Lyrics
#   עוֹשֶׂה שָׁלוֹם בִּמְרוֹמָיו
